\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. The livelihood of a Christian\cf0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 Should not be seen as trivial
\par Do you see yourself as perfect
\par Without need whatsoever?
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Deceive not yourself in thought
\par That your perfection's complete,
\par Over Gods commands, meditate,
\par And by that, measure your footsteps.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. The good person restrains himself,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 From acts of idolatory
\par  Does all he can for his neighbour,
\par To enhance his benefits,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He truly loves his brother,
\par  And shows him kindness each day
\par  He sees not himself a fitting,
\par  Nor see himself as one upright.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.  Dear soul, have your life as transformed,
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0  To be like that of Jesus,
\par  In this, avoid arrogant life,
\par \pard     Cast unholy things from you.\tab 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\ulnone\b0 
\par Put to test all that you do\cf0 
\par  And uphold that which is right.
\par  Repentance will save and guide you
\par  And to become a child of God,
\par 
\par \pard\fi-135\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par    4.  In faith only shall thou worship
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Jesus and realize His pow'r
\par It's He who can make life anew,
\par Source of peace, a mighty tow'r
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Should the law condemn your works
\par And drive you to frustration,
\par Christ shall then be your source of light,
\par And your much needed salvation.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-135\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5. Our Lord Jesus, help us to know
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj  Whatever your wishes are.
\par Strengthen thou the faith that we have,
\par To enable us prevail.
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj Make us know our true status,
\par So that we shall come to Thee.
\par For you 'll never call us to Thee
\par When we keep deceiving ourselves.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Into our hearts have Thou planted
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0 The pow'r and soul of your word,
\par For the purpose of revealing
\par Our heart's thoughts and projections.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par May we have your attention,
\par That we do not lost our way.
\par May we hear Thy voice in future,
\par \pard     Calling: come, thou that are blessed.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

